title: "Analysis code: respiratory viruses, pneumococcal carriage density and symptomatic illness in Blantyre children under five"
abstract: >-
  Statistical analysis and figure-generation code for a cross-sectional study of
  respiratory virus detection, nasopharyngeal pneumococcal carriage density and
  symptomatic acute respiratory illness in children under five years of age in
  Blantyre, Malawi.
